            <run>Crude death rate reflects the number of opioid overdose deaths per 100,000 persons. Rates based on fewer than 20 deaths are flagged as unreliable and excluded. Population estimates are U.S. Census Bureau bridged-race estimates as reported in CDC WONDER.

Source: Multiple Cause of Death 1999-2020, CDC WONDER Online Database, released 2021 - </run>
            <run auto-url='true' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://wonder.cdc.gov/wonder/help/mcd.html#&amp;quot;' underline='true'>https://wonder.cdc.gov/wonder/help/mcd.html#</run>
            <run>

Map based on Longitude (generated) and Latitude (generated).  The view is filtered on State, which excludes Alaska, Hawaii, North Dakota, South Dakota and Wyoming.</run>
